  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>KClO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>FeSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KCl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>The above reaction was studied at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> by monitoring the concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> in which initial concentration was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> and after half an hour became <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>. The rate of production of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is _______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(Nearest integer)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "333",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>KClO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>FeSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KCl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>From the above equation, rate of decomposition&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and rate of production of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;can be written as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Rate</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>decomposition</mi><msub><mi>FeSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Rate</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>production</mi><mrow><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></msub></math></p><p>Rate of decomposition of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Change</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>in</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>concentration</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>time</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>in</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>seconds</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1800</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Rate of production of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>1800</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>333</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
  }
